00:18:43.185 --> 00:18:44.005
So, think about it.

00:18:44.005 --> 00:18:48.651
Before Foursquare, the way you found out
about these local restaurants is you would

00:18:48.651 --> 00:18:52.710
have to be a local, you know a local and
speak a foreign language.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:57.250
And now we can sort of just run
a MapReduce and figure this all out.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.458
I like to tell this story because,
I think,

00:18:59.458 --> 00:19:03.540
perhaps, many people in this room, I'm
like very proud of my ethnic heritage and

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.240
my ability to sort of find
a great Chinese restaurants.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:11.740
