00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:11.290
work out, and also risky for the firm
that doesn't have a lot of human capital.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:15.660
And so I've seen companies as big
as Microsoft and smaller companies,

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:20.420
